    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "coach_paldea_rival_first_01",
      "hash64": "A531A4C1857B4665",
      "text": "Man, Blueberry Academy’s awesome![VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 33,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "coach_paldea_rival_sp01_00",
      "hash64": "38E7FF6224AD0CEA",
      "text": "It’s wild how different Blueberry Academy is from\\nour school back home, huh?[VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 76,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "coach_paldea_rival_sp01_01",
      "hash64": "38E8006224AD0E9D",
      "text": "I snagged a quick look inside the Terarium. I can’t\\nbelieve it’s all underwater! It all looks just like...\\r\\nregular above-water![VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 106,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 130,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "coach_paldea_rival_sp01_02",
      "hash64": "38E7FD6224AD0984",
      "text": "And I heard the school puts a super-heavy focus\\non Pokémon battling, too!\\c\\nThat means I can battle to my heart’s content\\nhere, right? Right?![VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 73,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 143,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "coach_paldea_rival_sp01_select_01",
      "hash64": "3C8568E6B4C9FE6C",
      "text": "Yeah! Great, right?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "coach_paldea_rival_sp01_select_02",
      "hash64": "3C856BE6B4CA0385",
      "text": "Uh, within reason",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "coach_paldea_rival_sp01_03",
      "hash64": "38E7FE6224AD0B37",
      "text": "Yesss! As soon as I’ve taken care of what you\\ncalled me for, I gotta battle every student here![VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "coach_paldea_rival_sp01_03b",
      "hash64": "5F4095C4520A416F",
      "text": "Oh, yeah! Sorry!\\c\\nYou’re right—I need to save some energy to\\nbattle you too![VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 78,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "coach_paldea_rival_sp01_04",
      "hash64": "38E7FB6224AD061E",
      "text": "[VAR 0xBD06(0000)]Y’know, I’m really glad you invited me,\\n[VAR 0x0100(0000)]!\\r\\nThanks\\r\\nso much![VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
