    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "coach_paldea_rival_sp02_00",
      "hash64": "DFB34148DD5BE9DD",
      "text": "I had a walk around the Terarium, and there were\\nSO MANY Pokémon I’d never seen before![VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "coach_paldea_rival_sp02_01",
      "hash64": "DFB34048DD5BE82A",
      "text": "I thought about this a lot in Kitakami, too—it’s so\\ncool seein’ unfamiliar Pokémon just living their\\r\\nlives as they do in nature![VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 100,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 131,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "coach_paldea_rival_sp02_02",
      "hash64": "DFB33F48DD5BE677",
      "text": "Reading about ’em in textbooks can’t hold a\\ncandle to seeing ’em for real, y’know?[VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 82,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "coach_paldea_rival_sp02_select_01",
      "hash64": "F1D997FD29AB7FE9",
      "text": "It’s so real this way!",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "coach_paldea_rival_sp02_select_02",
      "hash64": "F1D994FD29AB7AD0",
      "text": "It’s so novel this way!",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "coach_paldea_rival_sp02_03",
      "hash64": "DFB33E48DD5BE4C4",
      "text": "Exacto! You get me![VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "coach_paldea_rival_sp02_04",
      "hash64": "DFB33D48DD5BE311",
      "text": "Though, come to think of it, I guess there was a\\ntime when even the wild Pokémon of Paldea were\\r\\nbrand-new to me![VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 115,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "coach_paldea_rival_sp02_05",
      "hash64": "DFB33C48DD5BE15E",
      "text": "I actually moved to Paldea when I was seven.[VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 44,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "coach_paldea_rival_sp02_06",
      "hash64": "DFB33B48DD5BDFAB",
      "text": "I hadn’t had a taste of Pokémon battles yet back\\nthen. Sometimes I forget what it was like being\\r\\nthat age![VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 96,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 109,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "coach_paldea_rival_sp02_07",
      "hash64": "DFB33A48DD5BDDF8",
      "text": "I guess it’s good to keep having that same sense\\nof wonder as when we were young![VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 81,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "coach_paldea_rival_sp03_00",
      "hash64": "3618EB5078C573EC",
      "text": "[VAR 0xBD06(0000)]So, [VAR 0x0100(0000)]! You know\\nabout\\r\\nthe\\r\\nBB\\r\\nLeague,\\r\\ndon’t you?[VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
