    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "coach_paldea_rival_sp03_select_01",
      "hash64": "6EEFD91B8165C766",
      "text": "Sure I do!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "coach_paldea_rival_sp03_select_02",
      "hash64": "6EEFD81B8165C5B3",
      "text": "First I’ve heard of it...",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "coach_paldea_rival_sp03_01",
      "hash64": "3618EC5078C5759F",
      "text": "I KNEW it! Why didn’t you tell me right away?![VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 46,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "coach_paldea_rival_sp03_01b",
      "hash64": "B1CF89BD37877CE7",
      "text": "I’m not falling for that! I’ve done my homework![VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 48,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "coach_paldea_rival_sp03_02",
      "hash64": "3618ED5078C57752",
      "text": "And what’s more, everyone’s saying the\\nChampion of this League is YOU![VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 70,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "coach_paldea_rival_sp03_select_03",
      "hash64": "6EEFD71B8165C400",
      "text": "It’s true!",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "coach_paldea_rival_sp03_select_04",
      "hash64": "6EEFDE1B8165CFE5",
      "text": "First I’ve heard of it...",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "coach_paldea_rival_sp03_03",
      "hash64": "3618EE5078C57905",
      "text": "You ARE the Champion! C’mon, you shoulda told\\nme the awesome news sooner![VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 73,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "coach_paldea_rival_sp03_03b",
      "hash64": "B1D659BD378D4A05",
      "text": "You can’t fool me! I’ll call witnesses if I have to![VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 52,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "coach_paldea_rival_sp03_04",
      "hash64": "3618E75078C56D20",
      "text": "I am just drooling to battle the Champion of the\\nBB League! But even more importantly...[VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 88,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "coach_paldea_rival_sp03_05",
      "hash64": "3618E85078C56ED3",
      "text": "I’m SO proud that my rival’s been smashing it all\\nover the place![VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 65,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "coach_paldea_rival_sp03_06",
      "hash64": "3618E95078C57086",
      "text": "So...I guess what I’m saying is...I shall forever\\nremain proud to be your rival![VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 80,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "label": "coach_paldea_rival_trade_01_00",
      "hash64": "54F628899E5038A6",
      "text": "Whoops, I got a little formal there. Just too\\nstruck by your accomplishments, I guess![VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 86,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 34,
      "label": "coach_paldea_rival_trade_01_01",
      "hash64": "54F629899E503A59",
      "text": "Y’know, it just occurred to me—we’ve battled\\ntons, but we’ve never traded once![VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
